{
    "note": "The arithmetic both ports have to agree on, case by case, with the answer written out. The browser's tests read this file and so does NE.Test.Standard.UI.Charts, so a change to one port that the other did not get fails on both sides. The answers are the ones the browser's own tests already pinned by hand; a number is compared to nine decimals, a path string exactly. A moment is here too: both ports number it by the wall clock it is written with, since a round step has to land on a round clock reading on both; how a text reads as a moment is the framework's written-moment corpus's, and only the number it comes to is here. A name is not, its number being the order the rows happened to arrive in.",
    "moments": [
        { "case": "the epoch itself", "text": "1970-01-01T00:00:00.000", "written": { "year": 1970, "month": 1, "day": 1, "hour": 0, "minute": 0, "second": 0, "millisecond": 0 }, "expected": 0 },
        { "case": "a moment is the wall clock it is written with, whatever zone the reader sits in", "text": "1970-01-01T00:00:10.000", "written": { "year": 1970, "month": 1, "day": 1, "hour": 0, "minute": 0, "second": 10, "millisecond": 0 }, "expected": 10000 },
        { "case": "a date with no clock on it", "text": "2026-09-13", "written": { "year": 2026, "month": 9, "day": 13, "hour": 0, "minute": 0, "second": 0, "millisecond": 0 }, "expected": 1789257600000 },
        { "case": "a day of the month, to the minute", "text": "2026-09-13T14:35", "written": { "year": 2026, "month": 9, "day": 13, "hour": 14, "minute": 35, "second": 0, "millisecond": 0 }, "expected": 1789310100000 },
        { "case": "a moment to the millisecond", "text": "2026-09-13T14:35:09.250", "written": { "year": 2026, "month": 9, "day": 13, "hour": 14, "minute": 35, "second": 9, "millisecond": 250 }, "expected": 1789310109250 },
        { "case": "a year under a hundred is that year, not one in the 1900s", "text": "0050-06-15T12:00:00", "written": { "year": 50, "month": 6, "day": 15, "hour": 12, "minute": 0, "second": 0, "millisecond": 0 }, "expected": -60574996800000 }
    ],
